Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: `guard.map` needs a field projection
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/local_cell_guard_map_rejects_detached_values.jet:6:58
    |
  6 | inspect: fn(cell: Cell<Pair>) { _: cell.guard_read().map(fn(pair) { pair.left + pair.right }) }
    |                                                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A mapped guard must point into the value covered by its original dynamic loan
 Fix: Write `.map(fn(value) { value.field })`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch
